---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Navbar, Footer, WhatsAppBar } from '../components/index.astro';
import { wa, email, social } from '../data/site';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | 347 Awakening" description="How 347 Awakening handles your data: the Google Analytics, Fonts, Forms, Maps, and TikTok services used by the 347 Happy Life Happy World website.">
  <Navbar wa={wa} />
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
    <p class="text-gold-ink font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4">Your Privacy</p>
    <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-deep-blue mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="space-y-6 text-body leading-relaxed">
      <p>This page explains the information flows used by the 347 Happy Life Happy World website. Information you send to us through email, WhatsApp, the booking form, or the free meditation mailto form is used to respond to your request and arrange the service you asked about.</p>
      <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-deep-blue">Services used on this website</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-3">
        <li><strong>Google Analytics:</strong> the site loads Google Analytics with measurement ID G-NCM8XJXS9T to measure visits and site usage. Google may process browser, device, and usage information under its own terms and policies.</li>
        <li><strong>Google Fonts:</strong> the site requests Cormorant Garamond and Inter from Google Fonts. Your browser connects to Google to retrieve the font stylesheet and font files.</li>
        <li><strong>Google Forms:</strong> the booking page embeds a Google Form. Details submitted there are sent to Google and made available to 347 Happy Life Happy World for booking enquiries.</li>
        <li><strong>Google Maps:</strong> the contact/location page embeds a Google Maps frame and links to Google Maps. Loading or using those features may send requests and technical information to Google.</li>
        <li><strong>TikTok:</strong> the Master Kaie section loads TikTok's embed script when the video is near the viewport. TikTok may receive technical information and may set or read information according to its own policies.</li>
        <li><strong>Email and contact processing:</strong> mailto links open your configured email application and send the information you choose to the displayed contact address. WhatsApp links open WhatsApp; messages are processed by WhatsApp and by us.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>The website does not provide an on-site account system or payment form. To ask what information is held in our contact records, email <a class="text-gold-ink underline" href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>. This page describes the current website implementation and is not a statement about policies operated by the third-party services listed above.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
  <Footer wa={wa} email={email} fb={social.fb} ig={social.ig} yt={social.yt} tt={social.tt} />
  <WhatsAppBar wa={wa} />
</Layout>
